{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56197","headline":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 三十七 · 杜光庭","name":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 三十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庚子末，居家无定活。\n禾苗被害多，亲戚相欺夺。\n糊口并无余，妻子单眠活。\n江南虽得熟，向後亦号哭。\n灾殃则应逢，处处唯空屋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}